flowchart TD
    A[Camera Input]
    B[Pose Estimation]
    C[Motion + Posture Analysis]
    D[Fall Confidence]
    E[10-15s Confirmation Window]
    F{Cancelled?}
    G[Emergency Confirmed]
    H[IR / SOS / Local Alert]
    I[Return to Safe State]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F
    F -- YES --> I
    F -- NO --> G --> H
